Description: FS INTEGRITY
 Sovereign filesystem consistency verifier and superblock/inode integrity auditor in pure openOODA.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 multi-filesystem superblock auditing, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
